return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:53+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:53+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Inaunganisha tovuti hii ya WordPress na Zinn Digital® ili vifungu vilivyopangwa viweze kuchapishwa humo. Bandika msimbo wa kuoanisha kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn® na programu-jalizi huweka kitambulisho chake yenyewe — hakuna kinachonakiliwa kwa mkono.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP ya tovuti hii haiwezi kuunda kumbukumbu, kwa hiyo chelezo haikuweza kutengenezwa.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Imeshindikana kuunda faili la muda.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Faili za tovuti hii hazikuweza kuwekwa kwenye kumbukumbu.','The archive could not be read back.'=>'Haikuweza kusomeka tena kumbukumbu hiyo.','The backup could not be uploaded.'=>'Chelezo haikuweza kupakiwa.','The backup upload was rejected.'=>'Upakiaji wa nakala rudufu ulikataliwa.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Mtumiaji huyu wa WordPress hawezi kuchapisha machapisho, kwa hiyo muunganisho uliotengenezwa sasa hauwezi kuchapisha pia. Ingia kama mtumiaji anayeweza kuchapisha, kisha ujaribu tena.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Nywila za programu zimezimwa kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hiyo hatuwezi kuunda kitambulisho. Mwombe mwenyeji wako aziwashe, au unganisha tovuti kwa kutumia nywila unayojiundia mwenyewe kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress haikuwezi kuunda kitambulisho cha tovuti hii. Hakuna kilichotumwa popote.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® kutoka kwenye tovuti hii. Hakuna kilichounganishwa, و utambulisho tuliounda umeondolewa. Hakikisha kuwa tovuti inaweza kufanya maombi ya kutoa data, kisha jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikukubali msimbo huo wa uoanishaji. Hakuna kilichounganishwa. Tengeneza msimbo mpya kwenye dashibodi yako na ujaribu tena.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Zinn Digital® sasa inaweza kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosting ya Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizopo, vikoa na uwekaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili ziwe na furaha.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri wataalamu wanaofanya hili kwa ajili ya maisha','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','This site is connected to Zinn Digital®, publishing as %s.'=>'Tovuti hii imeunganishwa na Zinn Digital®, inayochapisha kama %s.','To disconnect, revoke the “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password on %s.'=>'Ili kukata muunganisho, batilisha nenosiri la programu la “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” kwenye %s.','your profile'=>'wasifu wako','Connect this site'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Fungua dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, nenda kwenye Yadi ya Maudovu → Tovuti zingine, na ubonyeze “Pata nambari ya kuoanisha”. Ibandike hapa chini.','Pairing code'=>'Msimbo wa kuoanisha','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Inaisha muda wa dakika theluji tatu baada ya kuitengeneza, na inaweza kutumika mara moja tu.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Huruhusu kuunganisha tovuti hii.']];